THE CC BY-SA 4.0 TERMS, IN SHORT

  No package is published yet. The licence says that you may share and adapt licensed material if you:
    * give appropriate credit to Alchemia LTDA and to the original sources listed in docs/SOURCES.md,
      link to the licence and indicate whether you made changes;
    * distribute what you build on it under the same licence (ShareAlike);
    * add no legal terms or technical measures that restrict others from doing what the licence permits.

  This is a human-readable summary and not a substitute for the licence. The legal code governs.
  No warranties are given.

NOT COVERED BY THESE LICENCES

  * The ATHANOR curation pipeline. It is proprietary software of Alchemia LTDA, it is not in this
    repository, and nothing here grants a right in it.
  * The Alchemia, ATHANOR and AURORA names, wordmarks and symbols, including those placed inside the
    figures of assets/. They are trademarks and closed artwork of Alchemia LTDA. They may be reproduced
    unaltered when you refer to this project. They may not be modified, redrawn, or used to imply
    endorsement, affiliation or origin.
  * The raw data of the upstream sources. AURORA will publish a curated, deduplicated derivative. For raw
    data, go to the original project and read its terms (docs/SOURCES.md).

ATTRIBUTION FOR DOWNSTREAM USE

  Credit Alchemia LTDA and the sources of the compounds you use, citing their papers. They are listed in
